/* Ice 2 — es
   App-owned UI strings, resolved through DragonKit's L(_:) so the app follows the
   language chosen in Settings ▸ General without a relaunch.

   Keys are SEMANTIC (app.general.showOnClick), never the English text: an English-text
   key makes every copy edit a key rename across seven files, and it cannot express two
   different strings that happen to read the same in English.

   The `app.` prefix is load-bearing. DragonKit's L(_:) resolves its own module bundle
   FIRST, so a key beginning `DragonKit.` here could never win — dragon-kit
   CONFORMANCE.md §R8 makes defining one a violation for exactly that reason. Shared
   wording (OK, Cancel, the pane titles, the whole Backup/Uninstall/Updates chrome) is
   read straight from the kit's table instead of being duplicated here. */

